The 'web-client' folder contains all frontend assets and configuration for the Shattered Archive web application, serving as the user-facing interface that runs in browsers. It includes the main application entry point (index.html), React project setup with TypeScript configuration (tsconfig.json, package.json), and Vite build configuration (vite.config.ts) that handles development server and proxy rules. The folder also contains a separate status page entry point (status.html) for monitoring client health and performance.
